  "notable_quotes": [
    "The paper synthesized readily regenerated ultraselective microporous sorbents, including one selective for C2H6 over CO2, C2H2, and C2H4.",
    "Zn-atz-ipa showed similar 1 bar uptakes for all four gases at 298 K (1.8-2.0 mmol/g), but from 0-0.4 bar it adsorbed more C2H6 than CO2, C2H2, and C2H4.",
    "Adding SIFSIX-3-Ni, an ultraselective CO2 sorbent, should remove trace CO2 from four-component mixtures, enabling a one-step process."
